# Ignore everything in this directory
*

# Except .gitignore and dotenv file
!.gitignore
!.env
!.env.secrets.example

# Secret files consumed via compose `secrets:`. Real values stay ignored
# by the blanket `*` above; only the .example templates are committed.
!secrets/
secrets/*
!secrets/*.example

# config file
!config/
config/*
# Google OAuth client secrets. Calibre-Web writes real client_id/
# client_secret here once Google login is configured, so only the empty
# seed is committed; `make bootstrap` copies it into place.
!config/client_secrets.json.example
